  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "A moment later, Samsonov gets cold feet about the upcoming televised family performance and suggests canceling it entirely. Frustrated by Nina's lingering distrust, Samsonov absurdly offers that she cheat on him too, so they can be even at one-one. Nina sarcastically names local candidates before telling him to pull himself together. Let's listen to their argument in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Может, вообще не будем выступать?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Самсон, мы же обо всём договорились!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я ведь тоже живой человек.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Тогда постарайся ради наших детей.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Знаешь что? Измени мне тоже!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Чего? Что ты такое говоришь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Чтобы у нас счёт был один-один!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Тогда это никогда не закончится.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Иди, я тебе серьёзно говорю.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "И с кем мне изменить?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "С продавцом из продуктового магазина!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Ты совсем с ума сошёл, Самсон?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Прекрати глупости и просто соберись!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Ладно, я готов к выступлению.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now let's examine Samsonov and Nina's argument line by line. Samsonov makes a bizarre proposal to resolve their marital distrust.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Может, вообще не будем выступать?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Maybe we will not perform at all?' Samsonov suggests canceling the television performance.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Самсон, мы же обо всём договорились!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Samson, we agreed on everything!' Nina reminds him of their mutual agreement.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Я ведь тоже живой человек.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I am a living person too, after all.' Samsonov appeals to his emotional vulnerability.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Тогда постарайся ради наших детей.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Then try for the sake of our children.' Nina urges him to act responsibly for the family.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Знаешь что? Измени мне тоже!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You know what? Cheat on me too!' Samsonov makes an absurd retaliatory offer.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Чего? Что ты такое говоришь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What? What are you saying?' Nina expresses astonishment at his bizarre suggestion.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Чтобы у нас счёт был один-один!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'So that our score is one-one!' Samsonov uses sports scoring terminology to achieve parity.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Тогда это никогда не закончится.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Then this will never end.' Nina points out the flaw in his cyclical logic.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Иди, я тебе серьёзно говорю.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Go, I am telling you seriously.' Samsonov insists on his ridiculous proposal.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "И с кем мне изменить?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And with whom should I cheat?' Nina asks sarcastically using the 'with/as' form.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "С продавцом из продуктового магазина!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'With the clerk from the grocery store!' Samsonov names a local neighborhood candidate.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Ты совсем с ума сошёл, Самсон?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Have you completely lost your mind, Samson?' Nina questions his sanity with a common idiom.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nina",
   "t": "Прекрати глупости и просто соберись!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Stop the foolishness and just pull yourself together!' Nina orders him to focus on the performance.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "samson",
   "t": "Ладно, я готов к выступлению.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
